[00:07.46]Stars fall at my feet, keep me grounded as I reach
{"繁星落在我脚边 当我伸手时让我保持清醒"}
[00:15.25]Higher than I see, is there something there for me?
{"超越我所见的高度 那里是否有属于我的东西"}
[00:22.27]Pulling back the reins, letting go again
{"勒紧缰绳 又再次放手"}
[00:29.76]I'm not afraid, I'm not
{"我不害怕 真的不"}
[00:34.23]All my life, one page at a time
{"用一生时光 一页页书写"}
[00:40.68]I'll show you my, my true colors
{"我会向你展现 我真实的色彩"}
